{
  "name": "Solar V2 · 02 · Follow-up queue",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · Follow-up queue\nEvery 15 minutes, queue due Email follow-ups whose automation_enabled is Yes. Manual tasks stay on the dashboard. Stopped, completed and closed enquiries are excluded.\n\nImport inactive. Set Connection settings, then select your Google credentials. V2_Config starts TEST / automation No. Read CONNECTING.md before testing.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "1b1c6567-02db-51c0-a0e7-18901161c86c",
      "name": "Read first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -350
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/15 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0b235259-a815-5e7f-bc79-40339a1525f1",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
